  "description": "With the exceptional wheelset from DT SWISS and an ultra-precise drivetrain, this T.E.M.P.O. LTD is completely unleashed, revealing its devastating character from the very first pedal stroke.\n• The FOX 34 Factory offers an excellent weight/stiffness ratio. The Grip 2 cartridge is ideal with its four hydraulic adjustments. The internal characteristics of the Float DPS Factory shock have been worked by FOX according to our wishes. In turn, the suspension works in harmony with the T.E.M.P.O. kinematics. Compression can be adjusted across three firmness levels and fine-tune the sensitivity in the fully open position.\n• SHIMANO Deore XT M8100 two-piston brakes with 203 / 180mm discs with Ice Tech Freeza aluminium pads.\n• DT SWISS XMC 1501 Spline One wheels offer an unmatched weight, performance, and comfort ratio.\n• Transmission comes in the form of the SRAM X01 Eagle with Copper finish.",
